[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/76844602","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/3445#issuecomment-76844602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/3445","id":76844602,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc2ODQ0NjAy","user":{"login":"angxu","id":5187448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODc0NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5187448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu","html_url":"https://github.com/angxu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-02T22:50:41Z","updated_at":"2015-03-02T22:50:41Z","body":"I wrote an unit test that can reproduce this bug against HEAD.\n\n```\n    @Test\n    public void testMaxHeaderSize() {\n      final int maxHeaderSize = 8192;\n\n      final EmbeddedChannel ch = new EmbeddedChannel(new HttpResponseDecoder(4096, maxHeaderSize, maxHeaderSize));\n      final char[] bytes = new char[maxHeaderSize / 2];\n      Arrays.fill(bytes, 'a');\n\n      try\n      {\n        ch.writeInbound(Unpooled.copiedBuffer(\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\\r\\n\", CharsetUtil.US_ASCII));\n        ch.writeInbound(Unpooled.copiedBuffer(\"X-A-Large-Header: \", CharsetUtil.US_ASCII));\n        ch.writeInbound(Unpooled.copiedBuffer(bytes, CharsetUtil.US_ASCII)); // write 4096 bytes\n        ch.writeInbound(Unpooled.copiedBuffer(\"\\r\\n\\r\\n\", CharsetUtil.US_ASCII));\n        // uncomment the following line with above 3 lines commented out, and the test shall pass.\n        //ch.writeInbound(Unpooled.copiedBuffer(\"X-A-Large-Header: \" + bytes + \"\\r\\n\\r\\n\", CharsetUtil.US_ASCII));\n      }\n      catch (Exception ex)\n      {\n        //pass through so that we can check DecoderResult;\n      }\n\n      HttpResponse res = (HttpResponse) ch.readInbound();\n      assertTrue(res.getDecoderResult().isSuccess());\n    }\n```\n\nCan someone please take a look? This is blocking us from adopting Netty 4 - which we are eagerly looking forward to because it looks all great otherwise.\n\nThanks!\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/76844602/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"angxu","id":5187448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODc0NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5187448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu","html_url":"https://github.com/angxu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angxu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":245054212,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQyNDUwNTQyMTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/events/245054212","actor":{"login"